3Subs. by Ordinance No. XLII of 1959 s. 3.

(d) payments against cumulative allocations on liquidation under Article XXV
(c) of the Fund Agreement.
(4) The Federal Government may take all such steps as may be necessary to meet its obligation under paragraph (e) of section 3 of the amended Article V of the Fund Agreement.
